From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWrt device fix <noreply@example.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: enable WCSS reserved memory on JIDU6J11

OpenWrt now disables the shared IPQ9574 Q6 memory reservation by default,
so boards that do not use the integrated WCSS radio can reclaim the
43 MiB region.

JIDU6J11 enables the WCSS remote processor for its integrated 2.4 GHz
radio. Enable the matching q6_region reservation on this board as well,
without changing its address, size, or no-map property.

---
 target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi b/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi
--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi
@@ -710,3 +710,7 @@
 &q6v5_wcss {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&q6_region {
+	status = "okay";
+};
--
2.43.0
